  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yemen - Humanitarian mine action and protection against EO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will protect conflict-affected communities in Yemen from landmines and other explosive ordnance through mechanical clearance, survey, risk education, and victim assistance. It will focus on contaminated frontline areas where hazards block access to roads, water, health services, farmland, and safe return for displaced people. Priority groups include internally displaced persons, returnees, women, children, and persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
